    "summary": "Bearer: a **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** model.\n\nOnce per battle, as [your opponent's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, with the bearer on the battlefield, this Enhancement lets you spend as many as 4YP. Pick a **HERNKYN** unit of yours, and another for every 2YP spent. You can take those units off the battlefield and put them into **[Strategic Reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)**. None of them can be in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of an enemy unit that is not assailed.",
